 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-mapper-wave3",
  "date": "2026-11-06",
  "draft_py": "# M20 Knight of the Ebon Legion\n# 1. \"{2}{B}: This creature gets +3/+3 and gains deathtouch until end of turn.\"\n#    The activated self-pump (B3-modify-pt-self, Masked Blackguard \"{2}{B}: This creature gets\n#    +1/+1 until end of turn.\") and self-grant (B3-grant-kw-self, Fetid Imp \"{B}: This creature\n#    gains deathtouch until end of turn.\") as one Seq, MODIFY_PT then GRANT_ABILITY (the order of\n#    Sure Strike / Dire Fleet Warmonger's \"gets +N/+N and gains K until end of turn\").\n# 2. \"At the beginning of your end step, if a player lost 4 or more life this turn, put a +1/+1\n#    counter on this creature.\"  Frame + condition: `parse \"At the beginning of your end step, if a\n#    player lost 4 or more life this turn, draw a card.\"`; effect: Scion of the Swarm's\n#    PUT_COUNTER on the source.\nthis_creature = Selector(\n    count=QConst(value=1),\n    mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n    filter=FAnd(\n        children=(\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n        ),\n    ),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\npump = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(\n        parts=(\n            CostManaColor(color='B', amount=QConst(value=1)),\n            CostManaGeneric(amount=QConst(value=2)),\n        ),\n    ),\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.MODIFY_PT, {\n                'duration': DurationEot(),\n                'power': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=3)),\n                'target': this_creature,\n                'toughness': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=3)),\n            }),\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.DEATHTOUCH),\n                'duration': DurationEot(),\n                'target': this_creature,\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\nend_step_counter = TriggeredAbility(\n    event=TurnPhaseEvent(\n        phase=Phase.END_TURN,\n        actor=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n    ),\n    condition=FAtom(\n        pred=FAtomPred.EVENT_THIS_TURN,\n        count=QConst(value=4),\n        event=LifeLostEvent(),\n    ),\n    effect=A(Verb.PUT_COUNTER, {\n        'count': QConst(value=1),\n        'counter_kind': CounterKind.PLUS_1_PLUS_1,\n        'target': Selector(\n            count=QConst(value=1),\n            mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n            filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n            zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n        ),\n    }),\n)\nabilities = [pump, end_step_counter, *compiled]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "{2}{B}: This creature gets +3/+3 and gains deathtouch until end of turn.",
    "ir": "abilities[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "At the beginning of your end step, if a player lost 4 or more life this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.",
    "ir": "abilities[1]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "Activated: Seq of the B3 self-pump (Masked Blackguard) and B3 self-grant (Fetid Imp), same self selector. End step: parse of '... if a player lost 4 or more life this turn, draw a card.' gives the frame and EVENT_THIS_TURN(LifeLostEvent(), count 4) (one player's total); effect is Scion of the Swarm's PUT_COUNTER. Self-check packs (scratch): 4 to one player -> counter, 3 -> none, 2+2 from two attackers -> counter, pump +3/+3 and deathtouch end at cleanup."
 },
